   398                                  ABSOLUTE $ ; Tell NASM: me want virtual address
   399                                  
   400 000003B2 <res 3Ch>               old_termios resb 60
   401 000003EE <res 3Ch>               new_termios resb 60
   402 0000042A <res 28h>               memory resd 10
   403 00000452 <res 20h>               stack resd 8
   404                                  
   405                                  memsize equ $-ehdr
